<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Paragon Trade downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Paragon Trade downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jensen Securities said it downgraded Paragon Trade Brands Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- reduced its earnings estimate to $1.86 per share from $2.05 for 1997, citing higher-than-expected startup losses in Paragon's feminine hygiene operation and increased competition in domestic diaper markets.</p>
<p>-- increased its 1998 estimate to $3 a share from $2.50.</p>
<p>-- Paragon shares closed at 18-1/2 Wednesday.</p>
</text>
